#: templates/default/list_views.html:9
msgid ""
"Views serve different zone variants to different clients based on the "
"network that queried the resolver. Each variant is named zone..variant (for "
"example, example.com..trusted) and must exist as a separate zone in PowerDNS "
"before it can be assigned here. Variants share a name but resolve "
"differently per view, so the same hostname can answer with different IPs "
"depending on the client's network."
msgstr ""
"Views melayani varian zon yang berbeza untuk klien yang berbeza berdasarkan "
"rangkaian yang membuat pertanyaan kepada resolver. Setiap varian dinamakan "
"zone..variant (contohnya, example.com..trusted) dan mesti wujud sebagai zon "
"berasingan dalam PowerDNS sebelum ia boleh diumpukkan di sini. Varian "
"berkongsi nama tetapi meleraikan secara berbeza bagi setiap view, jadi nama "
"hos yang sama boleh menjawab dengan IP yang berbeza bergantung pada "
"rangkaian klien."

